# Cargo build output.
target/

# rustfmt backup files (rare in modern rustfmt, but cheap to ignore).
**/*.rs.bk

# Release pipeline outputs (.deb / .rpm / .tar.gz / .asc) — produced
# by release/release.sh, not checked in. Lives at the top level so a
# stray `cargo clean` can't wipe signed artifacts.
/release-artifacts/

# PDFs are never checked in — local-only reference material stays
# out of the tree as large binary blobs.
*.pdf

# Editor / tool local state.
.claude/
.*.swp

# Maintainer-private state (cloud credentials for integration tests,
# vendor reference PDFs, GPG signing-key backup notes). Local-only —
# never check anything under here into the repo.
/private/
